      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Former Kiwi CYAMATE NZ (5) came from the back row and finished fourth when making his Australian debut at this circuit and distance last week. Fitter for that and draws on the front row this time so has strong claims. BOUGANVILLEA (3) has improved with racing this time in, culminating in a win at this circuit and distance last week when coming from wider to get home by 4.4 metres. Should enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position so could make it two on the trot. ULTIMATE RHAPSODY (7) added to his consistent form when he came from a similar barrier and finished runner-up at Menangle six weeks ago. Kept fresh since but must be respected. LAST TIME JOE (4) is better drawn and drops in grade so has to be included among the chances.",
